    "text_5fcb18f38a22": "Custom plan",
    "text_e3c100d09729": "Bespoke service",
    "w2_text_4ef0ae55a5a1": "Help to plan a future handover; you arrange the actual safekeeping and handover",
    "text_acf2b9ddf5a9": "For customers who want to plan who will take over and how the Recovery Kit, Storage Receipt and Recovery Password will reach the designated person securely.",
    "w2_text_6a92e93433b9": "Help to plan a future handover; you arrange the actual safekeeping and handover",
    "text_b74e14e5461f": "All core Standard services, plus:",
    "text_e3f6ed655b5f": "Bespoke recovery and handover plan",
    "text_ce3a02032a1b": "Designated recovery person and roles",
    "w2_text_30b24a44ee44": "Recovery file safekeeping and handover planning (planned, not yet available)",
    "w2_text_cc4f24746520": "Handover triggers and collaboration planning (planned, not yet available)",
    "w2_text_516146072410": "Coordinating professional roles (planned, not yet available)",
    "w2_text_908b43aadabb": "Lawyers and other professional advisers (planned, not yet available)",
    "text_b660008e9fee": "Bespoke recovery and handover rehearsal",
    "text_bba4521472f3": "Private client support",
    "text_962b903a4901": "Recovery Map content updates in the first year",
    "text_db9b9a0a0780": "At least two free updates, as specified in your plan.",
    "text_fa8bde505b28": "If someone else needs to act in the future, the difficult questions often include:",
    "text_7eec747c9bfe": "Who should take over? Who keeps the Recovery Kit, Storage Receipt and Recovery Password? When can handover begin? How can the required recovery materials reach the designated person securely? How should family members, trusted people and professional advisers work together?",
    "w2_text_cfef68e55413": "Help to plan a future handover; you arrange the actual safekeeping and handover",
    "text_b9a67c005122": "The aim is to plan who will take over and how the Recovery Kit, Storage Receipt and Recovery Password needed for recovery will reach that person clearly and securely.",
    "text_32daab31e6f6": "You have clear future handover needs",
    "text_e5c2c4e41ec4": "You have chosen, or plan to choose, a recovery person",
    "text_eb6d05573769": "You want different people to keep different recovery materials",
    "text_baacd680354e": "You want to plan future handover conditions",
    "text_3f2d701b0836": "You want clear roles for family members and the designated recovery person",
    "text_aca8fa45d43b": "You need lawyers or other professional advisers to take part",
    "text_72996f370cc2": "Your family, location or handover arrangements need tailored coordination",
    "text_f453ae0475c8": "Design overall recovery and handover arrangements around your circumstances.",
    "text_837cb98f1565": "Clarify who will take over and the roles of family members, trusted people and others involved.",
    "w2_text_99487da6e167": "Help to plan a future handover; you arrange the actual safekeeping and handover",
    "w2_text_2fe2e5aed3a4": "Plan when a future handover starts and how participants work together, according to your needs (planned, not yet available).",
    "text_299c98374cc2": "Professional collaboration",
    "w2_text_8155e513de19": "Include lawyers or other professional advisers in the overall arrangements where needed (planned, not yet available).",
    "text_b6ea7379852d": "Help those involved become familiar with the recovery and handover steps they may need to follow.",
    "text_af9cbc660c8b": "Ongoing support and coordination as specified in your bespoke plan.",
    "text_72efa77667a1": "At least two free updates, as specified in your bespoke plan.",
    "text_0e59430f0941": "You may arrange for yourself, trusted people or professional advisers to keep the Recovery Kit, Storage Receipt and Recovery Password separately, with future trigger conditions agreed in advance.",
    "w2_text_e54a8948fa6f": "When agreed conditions are met, the designated person may try to obtain the materials and begin recovery. This depends on the materials, authorisation and third-party conditions (planned, not yet available).",
    "text_dd467de80243": "LEGAVIK helps you plan this handover path in advance.",
    "text_e7c218061467": "Family members, the designated recovery person, participants and arrangements for keeping the Recovery Kit, Storage Receipt and Recovery Password may change after a handover plan is made.",
    "text_6a90bdb8228a": "During the service period, you can update this Recovery Map within your plan allowance. After the service period ends, saved archives can still be recovered, but this Map can no longer be updated. Renewal arrangements will be announced when available.",
    "text_67985706ac14": "Regular reviews and updates help keep the handover arrangements aligned with your family and circumstances.",
    "text_9d10d9b96194": "If lawyers or other third-party professionals are needed, their external fees are determined separately.",
    "text_354ab2b3bd09": "At least two free / as specified in the plan",
    "w2_text_37b3be624c4a": "Help to plan a future handover; you arrange the actual safekeeping and handover",
    "w2_text_2347ae4bc684": "Help to plan a future handover; you arrange the actual safekeeping and handover",
    "text_932742f0f578": "Collaboration with multiple people and professional advisers",
    "w2_text_3a7b07d45df3": "As specified in the plan (planned, not yet available)",
    "text_773ef7e6d1e4": "A bespoke recovery and handover plan for customers with clear future handover needs. Plan how family members or a designated recovery person will take over, with LEGAVIK helping to design safekeeping and handover arrangements for the Recovery Kit, Storage Receipt and Recovery Password. You retain the core recovery information and control throughout.",
    "cc_independent_tool_fingerprint_help": "After downloading, you can check the file fingerprint. If it matches the one shown here, it is the official original.",
    "launch_region_blocked": "LEGAVIK is currently available in Australia only.",
