    "mk_your_recovery_files_are_two_important_files_the": "Your recovery files are two important files: the Recovery Kit and the Storage Receipt. To recover, you also need the Recovery Password you set and keep yourself. LEGAVIK keeps no keys that could decrypt your information.",
    "mk_without_the_correct_recovery_password_and_the_matching": "Without the correct Recovery Password and the matching recovery files, the original information in the encrypted files can't be directly read or recovered, even if someone obtains them.",
    "mk_with_the_custom_plan_we_can_help_you": "With the Custom plan, we can help you plan how your recovery files and Recovery Password are kept and who can access them, based on your needs. Your recovery files are kept by you or people you choose. LEGAVIK doesn't hold your Recovery Password.",
