    "cc_76cd2ca85bf2": "Plans and orders",
    "cc_0881aa93694d": "After your service period ends, your uploaded archive stays stored long term and can still be recovered, but this Map can't be updated. We'll email you 30 days before it ends.",
    "cc_8eeac83b407a": "Order history",
    "cc_9cb3be0eeb4d": "We suggest doing a recovery now with the files you just downloaded",
    "cc_a812ce586dbd": "We suggest doing a recovery with this version's files",
    "cc_0c3abdcfbfc4": "No records yet",
    "cc_f6638d109662": "Please go back to your Customer Centre and choose the Map you want to update or upgrade.",
    "cc_67f894babaad": "This Map has been upgraded to Standard",
    "cc_3d009d0f4cce": "1 update purchased for this Map",
    "cc_80c4ca0f588b": "We suggest a Recovery Review every 6 months: check each item to see whether your assets, what recovery needs or where your information is kept have changed. If nothing has changed, you're done once you confirm. If something has changed, the review is complete once you publish a new version. The review itself doesn't use an update; publishing a new version uses 1 update.",
    "cc_260c5f02ecb7": "Why do a Recovery Review?",
