    "text_235b435238eb": "Your country or region",
    "text_da590a8fe3ce": "Please select",
    "text_1249fbcbf760": "State, province or region",
    "text_952e7e2c735d": "Province or region",
    "text_89ef6b34a1c2": "Please enter the country and region where you currently are. You'll also need to enter a billing address at payment. Payments we can't verify are held for a manual check, and your plan won't be activated automatically.",
    "text_ed3b4b23afb7": "Account and security",
    "text_6b51c3170e67": "Your sign-in password is only for signing in to your LEGAVIK account. It isn't your Recovery Password, and changing it doesn't affect any Recovery Map, Recovery Kit or Storage Receipt.",
    "text_692846b33a77": "You keep your Recovery Password yourself. LEGAVIK doesn't store it and can't retrieve or change it for you.",
    "text_a52e570c9b95": "Live chat",
    "text_b53f9d468b2a": "There are no support conversations to show. You can browse the knowledge base or see how to get support on our contact page.",
    "text_ac9db55647b2": "Browse the knowledge base",
